cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these models, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "Learned Stabilisation-Parameter Models for Incompressible Navier-Stokes (PC-AiStab + ADJSTAB)"
abstract: >
  Trained inference models for the learned stabilisation parameter tau of a
  SUPG/PSPG/LSIC stabilised finite-element incompressible Navier-Stokes solver.
  Two complementary multipliers: the isotropic, SH-supervised PC-AiStab network
  (ONNX; SH-target and residual-recovery campaigns, 5 seeds x 4 constraint
  variants) and the anisotropic, discrete-adjoint-supervised ADJSTAB model
  (portable JSON; 17 features, 17-32-32-1 MLP).
